sub_questions.text:
125 cumecs of sewage of a city is discharged in a perennial river which is fully saturated with oxygen and flows at a minimum rate of 1600 cumecs with a minimum velocity of 0.15 m/sec. If the 5-day BOD of the sewage is 300 mg/l, find out whether the critical DO will occur in the river. Assume—
(i) coefficient of purification of the river as 4.0;
(ii) coefficient of DO is 0.12;
(iii) ultimate BOD is 120% of the 5-day BOD of the mixture of sewage and river water.
